Docker Deployment For Selenium:
-------------------------------
    > Why docker for selenium:
          Before Docker:
          ---------------
            - install manually
              python
              chrome
              chromedriver
              dependencies

            - problems:
              - works in your system -> fails in QA/Prod
              - version mismatch issues
              - setup time is high

          With Docker (Containerization):
          -------------------------------
          Package everything together
            - your selenium code
            - python
            - browser
            - dependencies

          Results:
          --------
          Runs same everywhere (Ubuntu, Jenkins, Cloud)
          No setup issues
          Easy CI/CD integration












